Personally? I wouldn't move a square until I had an amulet of lifesaving
on. If you die without one, you will kick yourself very hard, and if you
don't die, you will have won the game, so it was obviously a good enough
choice. Improving basics like MR, reflection, and AC before wishing
for lifesaving is reasonable but, if you don't intend to to wish for
artifacts, I can't think of anything with a better potential return this
early in the game.

Even if you did intend to wish for artifacts, I would be torn between
AoLS and Gauntlets of Defense (which I would likely have picked up
instead of the speed boots, but your choices were fine).

Best of luck!

